  "editorial_notes": [
    "Five languages independently written against the full original Chinese and the shared batch10 brief; no translation service or incoming archive.",
    "All original argument stages and substantive examples retained in 7/5/7/6/7 sections. Repetitive scaffolding replaced with developed scenes; qualifications integrated locally rather than appended after every claim.",
    "Chinese and English edited in parallel; Traditional Chinese generated offline. Existing chapter 45 prose remains frozen; only related navigation labels can change.",
    "Ch46: three desire moments are an interpretive lens, not an irreversible psychological law. Harm can still be reduced after intense craving; desire itself is not guilt. Contentment not imposed on unmet needs.",
    "Ch47: understanding requires observation, evidence and revision; local depth does not make distant lives identical. Adopted ming/clarity acknowledged alongside received ming/naming.",
    "Ch48: learning builds real ability; subtract defensive habits, not skills, identity, duty or boundaries. No complete self-erasure, automatic success or covert ownership through non-grasping.",
    "Ch49: all closing clauses retained. Care and teaching include safeguards, feedback and intervention; trust is rebuilt through verifiable action. Adults/citizens are not infantilized.",
    "Ch50: contrasting Wang Bi/Heshang Gong readings cited; no invented innate fate percentages or uninjurable elite. Prudence reduces avoidable risk without victim-blaming or lifespan guarantees; social conditions and collective protection retained.",
    "Exact Mencius precarious-wall wording distinguished from the familiar later paraphrase. Health and financial examples remain illustrative, not prescriptions.",
    "All classical source panels, source-paper website and stable URLs unchanged. Original six DOI destinations retained in every manuscript; index, neighbours and metadata localized."
